why=The approved model's `fact` reads `require left-pad` as providing `left-pad`. Its golden files are the toy's, but each listed fact is built with that same `fact`, so the mistake cancels out of exactness, and gate 6 accepted it while the examples could live in the model module. Gate 6 now requires them in `Models.ToyRequire.Examples`, which may import only `Mitos.Core` and which the model module must import; this model declares its own.
